#: crates/kassensturz-ui-bridge/qml/BankCheckPage.qml:230
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 is an amount of money, %2 and %3 are dates"
msgid ""
"If the difference comes from before you started using KassenSturz, a "
"starting balance of %1 dated %2 makes both agree. KassenSturz then has on %3 "
