msgid "Now called: %1"
msgstr "Teraz nazywa się: %1"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The AI changed what this saved chart shows; everything it did not name stays "
"as you set it. The figures are worked out by KassenSturz from your book. The "
